                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.8365/8: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Egypt</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hare</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-06-14">June 14, 1940</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>53. Your 103, 13th, noon, has been “repeated to Embassy Rome for such action as
                    may be possible in the circumstances.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
